# Base system
base
linux
# The linux-firmware metapackage pulls ~773 MB of blobs, and firmware is already
# compressed, so squashfs cannot claw any of it back - it lands on the ISO
# roughly 1:1 and was most of what pushed us past the 2 GiB release-asset limit.
# Only the subpackages a PC live medium can actually use are listed. Dropped:
# qcom (Snapdragon SoC - phones/ARM laptops; Qualcomm *Wi-Fi* is ath1xk/qca and
# ships in linux-firmware-atheros), mellanox and qlogic and nfp and liquidio
# (datacenter NICs and Fibre Channel HBAs).
linux-firmware-intel
linux-firmware-atheros
linux-firmware-realtek
linux-firmware-mediatek
linux-firmware-broadcom
linux-firmware-marvell
linux-firmware-amdgpu
linux-firmware-radeon
linux-firmware-nvidia
linux-firmware-cirrus
linux-firmware-other
intel-ucode
amd-ucode
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
sudo
polkit
dbus

